  "description": "<p>Heroes of Timeline is a deeply strategic, 2-player board game designed for players who love tactical gameplay without the influence of luck. Created by a dedicated indie game designer, Heroes of Timeline is built on the values of fairness, replayability, and immersive gameplay.</p>\r\n<p>Help us bring a good game to passionate board gamers and earn together with us:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Affiliates earn a very competitive&nbsp;<strong>commission per sale.</strong></li>\r\n<li>Payments are made monthly via bank tansfer, with no minimum payout threshold.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Affiliates will receive access to exclusive marketing assets, including high-quality visuals, banners, and pre-written promotional content.</li>\r\n<li>Dedicated support is available to help you optimize your campaigns.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>&bull; More about the game:</strong><br>Heroes of Timeline is a fast-paced, skill-based strategy game where players lead unique teams of heroes in battles of wit and precision. The game features:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>No randomness:</strong> Every move and outcome depends on your skill, not luck.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Asymmetric gameplay:</strong> Four distinct teams with unique abilities, offering endless tactical combinations.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Compact playtime:</strong> Games last 20-30 minutes, making it perfect for quick yet satisfying matches.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The game appeals to fans of classic strategy games like chess, but with modern mechanics and a captivating fantasy universe.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Purely tactical, no-luck gameplay.</li>\r\n<li>Perfect for gamers who love intense, head-to-head strategy.</li>\r\n<li>Asymmetric teams and heroes ensure high replay value.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to learn, hard to master&mdash;accessible for newcomers, challenging for veterans.</li>\r\n</ul>",
